{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27260","headline":"览杨校书文卷 · 章孝标","name":"览杨校书文卷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"跪伸霜素剖琅玕，身堕瑶池魄暗寒。\n红锦晚开云母殿，白珠秋写水精盘。\n情高鹤立崑仑峭，思壮鲸跳渤澥宽。\n谁有轩辕古铜片，爲持相并照妖看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}